<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Oh yes, I had forgotten to tell you something important.<PG>
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's progress is all being recorded by me. Therefore, even if you leave this world just as you are, you can view it from where you left off.<PG>
However, should it be forcibly interrupted in the middle of a scenario... 
{PAUSE ""}
I am terribly sorry, but you will have to view that scenario from the beginning.<PG>
If you absolutely must record in the middle of a scenario, there is a dedicated interface, so please use that.<PG>
I believe you have also obtained several References, but whether you view them is at <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's discretion.<PG>
Of course, viewing them will also let you know more of the stories that unfold in this world, and perhaps an important clue to solving the mysteries may be hidden in them.<PG>
For example, I believe you obtained the cherry-blossom festival poster... 
{PAUSE ""}
I think it would also be good to imagine, as you view things, what meaning this will come to have later on.<PG>
Now then, from here on, for a while, I will quietly watch.<PG>
Should you need anything, please call me at any time.（On the scenario selection screen, right-click an empty spot to call Mika Tachiki）<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------